        "Hosts EKS worker nodes, internal load balancers, and databases",
        "Because pods consume VPC IPs, size it at /22 (1,024 IPs) or larger",
        "Point 0.0.0.0/0 at the NAT Gateway in the same AZ"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "AZ spread",
      "items": [
        "Use at least two AZs (three preferred), each with a public/private subnet pair",
        "A NAT Gateway per AZ avoids cross-AZ charges and a single point of failure",
        "The sample allocation uses 10.0.0.0/19 and reserves 10.0.32.0/19 for growth"
